# i-CAPE Backend

## Architecture (required)

```text
Route → Controller → Service → Repository → Prisma → PostgreSQL
```

- No business logic in route definitions
- Prefer Prisma over raw SQL unless there is a real need
- Backend enforces all important business rules (never frontend-only)

## Domain enforcement

- Scope year-specific operations by `olympiadYearId`
- Treat each Olympiad Year as an independent registration cycle
- Admin-only authentication paths

## API & quality

- Keep `/api` prefix; return consistent JSON responses
- Never leak stack traces, DB errors, or secrets to clients
- Prefer proper TypeScript types; avoid `any` unless unavoidable
- Cloudinary credentials stay backend-only
